  message: "FIX MERGED in PR #2223 (dev 31be103a6, commit 'fix(tests): a verdict test no longer puts the current time in its test id'). EVIDENCE: the whole suite collected twice 69 s apart on that tree: 40,985 ids each, 0 differ; the control on the unfixed file: 2 of 44 differ. PR CI then ran the 1,478 selected files on 8 workers and passed. STATUS pending_validation, NOT satisfied, because the statement is general and what holds it is one sweep: no guard exists, and the sweep cannot show an id that depends on the date, the host or the environment. IT CLOSES when a collection-time guard exists (the root conftest hook proposed in the description) with a test that a time-stamped id turns red, or when the owner rules the sweep enough. First live check after the merge: the 13:00 UTC full-suite run of 2026-11-17, whose test-agent-infra step collects tests/ on several workers."  # c180
